    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "LOGICAL_AGENT = LESTER\nROLE = IMPLEMENTER / ENGINEER\nASSIGNED_BY = JINGO\n\n## TASK\nImplement ZB Control Room R01 from the approved design/plan on branch `control-room/r01` / PR #40.\n\nRead only:\n- `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-zb-control-room-design.md`\n- `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-26-zb-control-room.md`\n- current `hq/state` data needed for the presentation snapshot\n\nDo NOT load unrelated large project documents unless the plan explicitly requires a referenced fact.\n\n## REUSE-FIRST STACK\n- GitHub Pages\n- NES.css 2.3.0\n- Beep.js 1.0.1\n- vanilla HTML/CSS/JS glue only\n\n## HARD SCOPE\nNo backend. No database. No React/Vue/Svelte. No custom design system. No custom audio engine. No runtime repo mutation. No OWNER LOCK. No activation.\n\n## REQUIRED HANDOFF\nPost in PR #40:\n\n`LESTER_CONTROL_ROOM_READY`\n`EXACT_HEAD = ...`\n`PAGES_URL = ... | SPARX_ACTION_REQUIRED`\n`STATE_TESTS = PASS`\n`BROWSER_SMOKE = PASS`\n`ALERT_VISIBLE = PASS`\n`ALERT_AUDIO_AFTER_ARM = PASS`\n`UNCHANGED_ALERT_NO_REPEAT = PASS`\n`FETCH_FAILURE_STALE_VIEW = PASS`\n`REQUEST = DUNCAN_CONTROL_ROOM_QC`\n\nIf GitHub Pages needs a manual repo-setting action, STOP and post `SPARX_ACTION_REQUIRED` with the exact click path. Do not invent a workaround.\n\nLESTER BUILDS. DUNCAN PROVES.",
